Instantiation Loop

latent_model = observe(world)
compressed = preserve_invariants(latent_model)
rendering = render(
    compressed,
    medium="story",
)
receiver_model = reconstruct(rendering)
difference = compare(
    latent_model,
    receiver_model,
)
improve(rendering, difference)

Writing is therefore optimization over reconstruction fidelity.

